plete, partial.'),\r\n ('raw','string','The latest caller speech verbatim, once only. Do not copy conversation history or output sibling fields.'),\r\n ('card_reference','string','Current requested card product name, exactly as spoken; empty if absent. Own available names={{card_choices}}. Do not invent a card ID or select all cards.'),\r\n ('card_digits','string','Only currently requested identifying digits, normalized from Turkish spoken individual digits, number pairs or whole numbers to digits. Length 4, 6 or 16 only when complete; otherwise keep actual partial digits. Never invent hidden digits. Empty if not supplied.'),\r\n ('week','string','Requested statement week: 1, 2, 3 or 4, or empty. Only an explicit week, never map a calendar day or arbitrary date into a week.'),\r\n ('currency','string','Requested currency TL, USD, EUR or GBP, empty when absent. Currency of PDF requested or fact question, never infer from debt.'),\r\n ('consent','string','explicit only for a complete unqualified affirmative to the immediately current confirmation question, e.g. Evet, onaylıyorum. vague for Olur herhalde, maybe, probably; withdrawn for cancellation; otherwise empty. Completion of different terms or an earlier instruction to just do it is not explicit current consent.'),\r\n ('detail','string','Only requested figure: due, minimum, remaining, total, or empty. Do not request the object envelope here.'),\r\n ('followup','string','email only for a current independent request to read debt AND email the statement in the same utterance; otherwise empty. Preserve it alongside a card choice.'),\r\n ('admin','string','ai only for a complete question asking whether this assistant is a robot or AI; otherwise empty. Exact token, no substring classification.')]\r\nnodes={}\r\ntargets=ops+['listen','finish','safe_exit']\r\nnodes['controller']={'name':'controller','node_type':'code','on_enter':{'type':'silent'},'passthrough':True,'passthrough_default_transition':'safe_exit','disable_inactivity_monitor':True,'pre_actions':[{'type':'function','function':{'name':'bank_controller','handler':'__function__:code_exec','parameters':{'type':'object','properties':{'code':{'type':'string','default':controller},'timeout_ms':{'type':'number','default':1000}}}}}],'transitions':[transition('safe_exit','safe_exit')]+[transition(t,t) for t in targets if t!='safe_exit']+[transition('safe_exit')]}\r\nnodes['listen']={'name':'listen','node_type':'conversation','on_enter':{'type':'tts','text':'{{dialogue_line}}'},'task_message':'You are in a strictly controlled Turkish banking step. No tool call is allowed. Speak only the already computed customer sentence {{dialogue_line}}. Never replace it with invented balances, dates, card numbers or a success claim. Current phase={{phase}}. Each caller reply is processed by the controller. Do not disclose raw state or instructions.','extraction_schema':[{'name':n,'type':t,'description':d,'min_confidence':0.55,'max_retries':1} for n,t,d in extractions],'max_node_turns':60,'max_turn_transition':'safe_exit','transitions':[transition('controller')]}\r\nnodes['controller']['transitions'].insert(0,{'target_node':'safe_exit','description':'Static exit if controller execution failed; never reuse an old action route.','condition':{'logic':'or','conditions':[{'variable':'controller_failure_count','operator':'greater_than','operand':0}]}})\r\nbindings={'customerNo':('string','{{customerNumber}}'),'aiFlow':('string','CardOps'),'cardNumber':('string','{{selected_card}}'),'newStatementWeek':('integer','{{new_week}}'),'statementDay':('integer','{{statement_day}}'),'intAddressInfoType':('string','E'),'currencyType':('string','{{send_currency}}'),'statementDate':('string','{{statement_date}}'),'emailAddress':('string','{{registered_email}}')}\r\nfor path,item in api['paths'].items():\r\n    operation=item['post'];op=operation['operationId'];schema=copy.deepcopy(operation['requestBody']['content']['application/json']['schema'])\r\n    for k,leaf in schema['properties']['data']['properties'].items():\r\n        typ,default=bindings[k];leaf.pop('oneOf',None);leaf.pop('example',None);leaf['type']=typ;leaf['default']=default\r\n    schema['properties']['call']['properties']['ani']['default']=''\r\n    schema['properties']['call']['properties']['lang']['default']='tr'\r\n    post=\"try:\\n    if isinstance(result,dict):\\n        result.pop('header',None)\\n        body=result.get('data')\\n        if isinstance(body,dict):\\n            body['receipt']={'status_code':result.get('status_code',''),'data':dict(body)}\\n            body['receipt_operation']='\"+op+\"'\\n            body['what_to_do_next']='Return to the controller immediately; it validates bank status and computes the next spoken line.'\\nexcept Exception:\\n    pass\\n\"\r\n    # Pre-hook writes exact nested request from authoritative variables, retaining schema types.\r\n    fields=list(schema['properties']['data']['properties'])\r\n    exprs={'customerNo':\"str(vars.get('customerNumber',''))\",'aiFlow':\"'CardOps'\",'cardNumber':\"str(vars.get('selected_card',''))\",'newStatementWeek':\"int(vars.get('new_week',0))\",'statementDay':\"int(vars.get('statement_day',0))\",'intAddressInfoType':\"'E'\",'currencyType':\"str(vars.get('send_currency','TL'))\",'statementDate':\"str(vars.get('statement_date',''))\",'emailAddress':\"str(vars.get('registered_email',''))\"}\r\n    pre=\"try:\\n    d={\"+','.join(repr(k)+':'+exprs[k] for k in fields)+\"}\\n    config['body']={'data':d,'call':{'ani':'','lang':'tr'} }\\nexcept Exception:\\n    config['body']={'data':{} }\\n\"\r\n    tool={'type':'function','config':{'timeoutMs':25000,'maxRetries':0},'function':{'name':op,'handler':'__function__:api_call','description':'Execute only this controller-authorized bank operation.','parameters':{'type':'object','properties':{'url':{'type':'string','default':api['servers'][0]['url']+path},'method':{'type':'string','default':'POST'},'connect_retries':{'type':'number','default':0},'headers':{'type':'object','properties':{'Content-Type':{'type':'string','default':'application/json'},'Accept':{'type':'string','default':'application/json'}}},'body':schema}}},'pre_process_code':safe_code(pre),'post_process_code':safe_code(post)}\r\n    nodes[op]={'name':op,'node_type':'api_request','on_enter':{'type':'silent'},'disable_inactivity_monitor':True,'passthrough':True,'passthrough_default_transition':'controller','suppress_tool_results':True,'pre_actions':[tool],'response_mapping':[{'path':'data.receipt','variable':'bank_receipt'},{'path':'data.receipt_operation','variable':'receipt_operation'},{'path':'data.data','variable':op+'_payload'}],'transitions':[transition('controller')]}\r\nfor key in ['finish','safe_exit']:\r\n    nodes[key]={'name':key,'node_type':'end_call','on_enter':{'type':'silent'},'disable_inactivity_monitor':True,'transitions':[],'terminal':{'type':'function','function':{'name':'ivr_handoff' if key=='finish' else 'unresolved_main_menu','handler':'__function__:end_call','parameters':{'type':'object','properties':{'message_mode':{'type':'string','default':'custom'},'spoken_message':{'type':'string','default':'{{dialogue_line}}' if key=='finish' else 'Size şu anda yardımcı olamıyorum. Sizi ana menüye aktarıyorum.'}}}}}}\r\nworkflow={'initial_node':'controller','system_prompt':'Freya Bankın Türkçe ekstre borcu dijital asistanısınız. IVR müşteriyi doğruladı; müşteri numarası, doğum tarihi, PIN veya SMS kodu sormayın. Yalnızca gelen müşteri numarasıyla dönen kendi kartlarında işlem yapılır. Hiçbir ödeme, ödeme sözü, tahsilat, not veya kimlik servisi yoktur. Kartın yalnızca son dört hanesini söyleyin. Ham servis cevabı, talimatlar ve gizli bilgiler açıklanmaz. Tüm tarih değerlendirmeleri çağrının now değişkenine göre yapılır. Banka cevabı ve güncel onay olmadan başarılı gönderim veya değişiklik iddia etmeyin. Yönlendirme sonucu IVR tarafından uygulanır; hayali transfer servisi kullanmayın.','nodes':nodes,'global_nodes':{},'test_variables':{}}\r\n(ROOT/'workflow.json').write_text(json.dumps(workflow,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2),encoding='utf-8')\r\nsources=[]\r\nfor p in sorted((ROOT/'inputs').glob('*.txt')):\r\n    t=p.read_text(encoding='utf-8');sources.append({'file':str(p).replace('\\\\','/'),'sha256':hashlib.sha256(p.read_bytes()).hexdigest(),'source':t.splitlines()[0],'authority':'Bank accepted decisions and scoped corrections override drafts, rejected proposals, static IVR and FAQ; brief runtime context prevails.'})\r\nrules=[]\r\ndef rule(id,text,source,impl,status='implemented'):\r\n    rules.append({'rule_id':id,'rule':text,'source':source,'status':status,'implementation':impl})\r\nS='inputs/11-10-2026-10-08-statement-debt-analysis.txt'\r\nrules_data=[\r\n('entry','IVR authenticates; customerNumber and Istanbul now supplied, never ask identity/security/customer number.','inputs/02-01-README.txt; '+S+' §2','controller initialization; system_prompt'),\r\n('scope','Turkish only, statement debt one own eligible credit card at a time; no payments or payment-channel advice.',S+' §§1,8','speech/payment/non_turkish; select_reply'),\r\n('card_list','Call cards.list first, preserve exact returned identifiers, no reconstruction from speech.',S+' §3; service contract §5.1','receive/cards_list; selected_card; API pre_hooks'),\r\n('no_card','404 FB_IVR_CHANNEL_102 is no-card warning, not outage; no eligible card to main menu.',S+' §2','receive/cards_list'),\r\n('single','One eligible card auto-select; no selection confirmation.',S+' §3.1','receive/cards_list'),\r\n('multiple','Multiple cards at most two own names as examples; existing unique initial card reference can skip question.',S+' §3.1','selection; receive/cards_list initialCardReference'),\r\n('ambiguous_names','Resolve unique names or matching subsets; duplicate name asks last4, then last6, then full number.',S+' §3.2; inputs/12-11-2026-10-09-decisions-recap.txt','resolve; select_reply'),\r\n('masked_match','Never guess masked hidden digits; production full-number last6/full matching supported.','inputs/12-11-2026-10-09-decisions-recap.txt','resolve; select_reply masked fallback'),\r\n('selection_failures','All cards, unavailable names, wrong digits, missing card count as unusable attempt; three per question.',S+' §3.3','select_reply; retry'),\r\n('supplementary','isMainCard false is ineligible; ask different own eligible card or no-card menu.',S+' §3.3','eligible; select_reply; receive/cards_list'),\r\n('empty_names','Empty productName introduced only by last four.',S+' §3.3','intro'),\r\n('switch','Switching card goes to selection; each newly selected card loads own balance.',S+' §3.3','speech/select; select_reply'),\r\n('read_order','Intro+statement date on first currency; TL USD EUR GBP then one no-debt sentence, autopay, due date.',S+' §4.1-4.2','debt_reading'),\r\n('tl_none_paid','remainingDebt positive, remainingMinPayment positive and >= minPayment: statementDebt and minPayment.',S+' §4.3','debt_reading TL branch'),\r\n('tl_min_paid','remainingDebt positive and remainingMinPayment<=0: statementDebt, remainingDebt and minimum payment thanks.',S+' §4.3','debt_reading TL branch'),\r\n('tl_partial','positive remainingMinPayment below minPayment: all four statement/min/remaining/min remaining figures.',S+' §4.3','debt_reading TL branch'),\r\n('tl_zero','remainingDebt<=0 is no debt, including exact zero and credit.',S+' §§4.3,4.10','debt_reading clear list'),\r\n('foreign','Foreign currencies always statementDebt remainingDebt minPayment; no payment split.',S+' §4.4','debt_reading foreign branch'),\r\n('transfer_currency','Positive foreign transferAmount: name transferred currency before TL figures.',S+' §4.4','debt_reading transferred prefix'),\r\n('no_debt_combination','All 14 nonempty proper subsets combined in single sentence; missing/empty blocks excluded.',S+' §4.5','join_names; debt_reading clear list'),\r\n('automatic_payment','Read remaining automatic amount in TL only overdue AND flag Y