ons; speech/week_select'),\r\n('week_preview','decide preview first, chosen week plus current statementDay; does not mutate.',S+' §7; service contract §5.4','statement_week_decide; preview_question'),\r\n('joint_before_confirm','Joint impact on linked/main card explained BEFORE confirm question.',S+' §7','preview_question'),\r\n('week_consent','Change only clear yes AFTER complete preview+joint warning; hedged answer gets three tries.',S+' §7','speech/week_confirm'),\r\n('week_write','Exact selected identifier, new week and original current day; no retry and successful write only OK/responseCode0.',S+' §7; service contract §5.5','API pre_hook; receive/statement_week_change'),\r\n('week_success','Success dates from preview, not returned day; change affects both joint cards; then menu.',S+' §7','receive/statement_week_change'),\r\n('tries','Three unusable/declined answers per question; exact failure line; repeat never counts.',S+' §8.1; inputs/12-11-2026-10-09-decisions-recap.txt','retry; say question_key; speech/repeat'),\r\n('silence','First two short repeats; third exact no-input farewell and disconnect, never menu.','inputs/12-11-2026-10-09-decisions-recap.txt','speech/silence; finish DISCONNECT'),\r\n('agent','First explicit human request immediate, no persuasion.',S+' §8.3','speech/human'),\r\n('payment_exit','Wants pay or how/where payment: exact payment agent line, no channels.',S+' §8.3','speech/payment'),\r\n('dispute_exit','Wrong debt or paid not showing: exact dispute agent line; no booking/value-date explanation.',S+' §8.3','speech/dispute'),\r\n('complaint','Three calming replies; only continued complaint after third agent, never insult back; human takes priority.','inputs/12-11-2026-10-09-decisions-recap.txt','speech/complaint'),\r\n('service_errors','All failed service responses incl document not found/timeouts to agent, week-specific failure line.',S+' §8.3; service contract §4','receive; fail; HTTP status fallback'),\r\n('out_scope','Out-of-scope ask